.TH PAGEFORMER-PUBLISHER 1 "2026-10-31" "Pageformer 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pageformer-publisher \- minimal graphical converter for Pageformer documents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pageformer-publisher
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pageformer-publisher
opens a small window that converts a Markdown file with the Pageformer
pipeline. Drop a file or click the box to choose one, select a format, export
and open the result. The Advanced section holds an optional template override,
the output directory and the confidential INI file.
.PP
The window calls the same library pipeline as
.BR pageformer (1).
It never parses, resolves or writes by itself, and it never displays a
confidential value.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I .pageformer.yaml
The local template, resolved from the source directory upward.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pageformer (1)
